## Step 6 — Run the Streamlit UI

```
streamlit run app.py
```

This opens a browser tab automatically. Upload a `.pdf` or `.txt` policy document, click "Run analysis," and watch the 5 stages run live with their own status messages, ending in the report and an expandable list of evidence-cited matches.

Try uploading the `sample_policy.txt` file that was auto-created in your folder when you ran `nodes_ingest_retrieve.py` earlier — it's a ready-made test document.

