## Step 10 — Package the story

Use this exact language (already fact-checked against what you actually built):

> "Built an agentic governance-mapping tool (LangGraph, Groq, ChromaDB) that
> retrieves relevant ISO 27001 / DPDP clauses via semantic search, maps them
> against uploaded policy documents through a schema-enforced LLM call, and
> hard-gates every compliance claim against the real source text before
> including it in the final report — verified via adversarial testing
> against both false-positive and true-positive documents."

If asked to explain it in an interview, use this 20-second version:
"It's a tool that reads a company policy document and tells you which ISO 27001 or DPDP rules it actually covers — but the key design decision is that every claim has to be backed by a real quoted sentence, checked in code, not just trusted from the AI. I built that after seeing how easy it is for an AI to sound confident about something that isn't actually true."

